{
  "_about": "The team rules, one table for both mirrors: the builder's lib/agentRules.ts (tests/agentic_ui/agent-rules.test.ts) and the agents service's _tree_issues (tests/agents/test_custom_agent_routes.py). Each case is the agent's MCP tools and its sub-agents as the spec writes them; `errors` are the paths that must carry an issue, and no other sub-agent path may.",
  "cases": [
    {
